@startuml sequence-worker-nightly
' What: the shared worker-kit contract (evilflowers-worker#13) as evilflowers-actions implements it. A kit consumer's
'       caller workflows use worker-nightly.yml, the resolve-worker and report-nightly-failure actions, image.yml
'       and deploy.yml. Every build locks evilflowers-worker to the ref its branch follows (develop: master; main,
'       master and tags: the newest release tag); every night dev is rebuilt when master moved; every deploy lands
'       in Loki and Tempo.
' Source: .github/workflows/worker-nightly.yml, image.yml, deploy.yml, .github/actions/resolve-worker,
'         .github/actions/report-nightly-failure, scripts/otlp-deploy.sh (this repo, 2026-11-22); reference
'         evilflowers-analyzer-service docs/diagrams/sequence-nightly-worker-bump.puml.
!include elvira.iuml
title Nightly: kit master -> <service>:develop -> evilflowers-dev

participant "worker-nightly.yml" as nightly
participant "evilflowers-worker\nmaster, v*.*.*" as kit
participant "GHCR\n:develop" as ghcr
participant "caller image\nworkflow" as publish
participant "runner pod\n(elvira-k3s)" as runner
participant "alloy-node\n:4318" as alloy

nightly -> kit : git ls-remote\nrefs/heads/master
kit --> nightly : head commit
nightly -> ghcr : skopeo inspect
ghcr --> nightly : label ...evilflowers-\nworker.revision
alt same commit, or held\n(KIT_REF), and not force
  nightly -> nightly : stop: a rebuild is a\nnew digest, a restart\nfor nothing
else master moved,\nno label, or force
  nightly -> publish : gh workflow run\n--ref develop\n-f reason=nightly
end

group caller image workflow (also on every push)
  publish -> kit : resolve-worker:\ndevelop -> master,\nmain / tag -> newest v*.*.*\n(no tag = error)
  kit --> publish : uv.lock + pyproject.toml\n(artifact, never committed)
  publish -> publish : tests on that lock
  publish -> ghcr : image.yml: build from\nthe artifact, push,\nlabels ...worker.revision\n/ .ref
  ghcr --> publish : digest
  publish -> runner : deploy.yml\n(develop only)
  runner -> runner : rollout restart,\nstatus, digest check
  runner -> alloy : POST /v1/logs\nevent.name=deployment,\nevilflowers.deploy.trigger,\nevilflowers.worker.*
  runner -> alloy : POST /v1/traces\nspan "deploy"
  opt nightly run failed
    publish -> publish : report-nightly-failure:\none issue per streak
  end
end
@enduml
